flowchart TD
 A[Customer Cancel] --> B[Order API: auth + idempotency]
 B --> C{Expected version and status?}
 C -->|yes| D[(PostgreSQL: order + outbox in one transaction)]
 C -->|no| E[Conflict / current state]
 D --> F[Outbox relay]
 F --> G[(Kafka keyed by order ID)]
 G --> H[Fulfillment consumer: inbox + version guard]
 G --> I[Refund consumer: provider idempotency]
 H --> J[Customer status projection]
 I --> K[Webhook / reconciliation]
 K --> J
